PHAST — Priority-Driven Hierarchical Scheduling

The executor is derived from the ROS 2 Dashing rclcpp client library and
retains the Open Source Robotics Foundation and other upstream copyright
notices in its source files. Upstream reference:
https://github.com/ros2/rclcpp
Validated Dashing source revision: 403aac966271132feadffca93dcfb24f6ab90efb

ROS 2/Cyclone DDS dependencies are fetched from upstream, not vendored.
Prepare them in a separate Dashing underlay; they remain subject to
their own licenses. See the README for the tested dependency versions.

Robot application sources, external SDKs, model weights and third-party
binaries are not included in this release.

The original project referred to ros2_tracing, ros2-picas, and ComP as
optional dependencies. They are not initialized submodules of this release:
https://github.com/ros2/ros2_tracing
https://github.com/rtenlab/ros2-picas
https://github.com/Man0xbfc00380/robospike
The default CPU profile does not require these optional projects.

